    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4fdb4ee4d942e7fb81536af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊！　在比赛粉丝群体里、\n有一个超有名点投票网站……\n“The 1st”……你看、这个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0019323ec6f2debac9d87299604b70aebbf4b2d3e95490b7e8813e52a0f250c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114101.json",
      "json_path": [
