      "source_text": "啊！　讨厌。\n我才没有那么贪吃啦！\n……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9584925b09320881f03e25fae33b9af011c1e687727debd24c31ece7f42a676b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
