    {
      "uid": "zhcn:932b6989b94bf778355345fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『樱花赏』『日本橡树大赛』『秋华赏』\n赢下这三场比赛的赛马娘\n被称为三后冠赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5e6dcf3be68d697924a79f04d62da4858fe29e297eef67b2accc043b407127e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
