        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76407f3d8aa47baaac38afb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白高峰和、爱如往昔。\n除了这两位伟大前辈以外、\n迄今再无赛马娘获此殊荣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f07641425878816a984da6d87eb44a9e00b77ae9b707c72c27e82bfdcdda508",
